{"id":"conseille_","lemma":"conseillé","pos":"verb","rank":4413,"glosses":["advisable"],"ipa":"/kɔ̃.sɛ.je/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f7/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-conseill%C3%A9.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-conseill%C3%A9.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Je ferai comme tu m'as conseillé.","en":"I'll do as you advise.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/28382","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},null]},{"text":"On me l'a conseillé.","en":"It's been recommended to me.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null]},{"text":"Elle lui a conseillé de voir un avocat.","en":"She advised him to see a lawyer.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"lawyer, attorney"}]},{"text":"Je lui ai conseillé de garder le secret.","en":"I advised him to keep the secret.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to keep"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"secret"}]},{"text":"Elle m'a conseillé d'aller là.","en":"She advised me to go there.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"there"}]}]}